# Fase 5 · Terceros, proveedores y compras (sin UI)
# Uso: Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code (extensión REST Client).
# Antes: dev-db.ps1 (aplica las migraciones 010–013) y `dotnet run --project src/Server/Pos.Server.Host`.
# Requiere un producto con lotes (paso 5) y la bodega de piso de venta (paso 6).

@host = http://localhost:5480
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### 1. Entrar como Propietario
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "dueno", "password": "Sup3rmercado-Seguro" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. Medios de pago sembrados (Efectivo, Débito, Crédito, Transferencia, Nequi, Daviplata, Bono)
# @name methods
GET {{api}}/cash/payment-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Consumidor final (tercero del sistema)
GET {{api}}/parties/by-identification?type=CC&number=222222222222
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Tercero con NIT y DV (un DV incorrecto responde 400 PARTIES.INVALID_NIT_CHECK_DIGIT)
# @name party
POST {{api}}/parties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personType": "Legal", "identificationType": "NIT", "identificationNumber": "800197268", "checkDigit": "4",
  "legalName": "Distribuidora Láctea SAS", "tradeName": "DisLácteos", "taxRegime": "48", "fiscalResponsibilities": ["O-13"],
  "email": "facturas@dislacteos.co",
  "contacts": [ { "name": "Pedro Vendedor", "position": "Vendedor", "phone": "3001234567", "isPrimary": true } ]
}

### 4b. El tercero se vuelve proveedor (plazo 30 días; si no factura, issuesInvoices=false → documento soporte)
# @name supplier
POST {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partyId": "{{party.response.body.id}}", "supplier": { "code": "DISLAC", "paymentTermDays": 30, "issuesInvoices": true } }

### 5. Producto con lotes y vencimiento, y su caja x24
# @name categories
GET {{api}}/catalog/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# @name yogurt
POST {{api}}/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product": { "sku": "YOG-FRESA-1L", "name": "Yogurt fresa 1 L", "categoryId": "{{categories.response.body.$[0].id}}", "baseUnitCode": "UND",
               "saleMode": "Unit", "productType": "Stockable", "tracksLots": true, "tracksExpiry": true },
  "generateBarcode": true,
  "price": 3500
}

###
# @name box
POST {{api}}/catalog/products/{{yogurt.response.body.id}}/packagings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Caja x24", "factor": 24 }

### 6. Bodega de piso de venta (copie el id de la bodega SALES_FLOOR)
# @name branches
GET {{api}}/organization/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# @name branch
GET {{api}}/organization/branches/{{branches.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@floor = {{branch.response.body.warehouses[0].id}}

### 7. Orden de compra → aprobar → enviar
# @name order
POST {{api}}/purchasing/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "{{supplier.response.body.id}}", "warehouseId": "{{floor}}",
  "lines": [ { "productId": "{{yogurt.response.body.id}}", "packagingId": "{{box.response.body.packagings[0].id}}", "quantity": 10, "unitCost": 60000 } ]
}

###
POST {{api}}/purchasing/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{api}}/purchasing/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Compra contra la orden: descuento, flete prorrateado, lote, retención → costo neto $2.425 por unidad
# @name purchase
POST {{api}}/purchasing/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "{{supplier.response.body.id}}", "warehouseId": "{{floor}}", "purchaseOrderId": "{{order.response.body.id}}",
  "supplierInvoiceNumber": "FE-1001", "invoiceDate": "2026-09-28", "paymentMode": "Credit", "invoiceTotal": 690300,
  "proration": "Value", "chargesTotal": 12000, "chargesNotes": "Flete",
  "lines": [ { "productId": "{{yogurt.response.body.id}}", "packagingId": "{{box.response.body.packagings[0].id}}", "quantity": 10, "unitCost": 60000,
               "discount": 30000, "lotNumber": "L-A1", "expiryDate": "2026-11-27", "orderLineId": "{{order.response.body.lines[0].id}}" } ],
  "withholdings": [ { "kind": "Retefuente", "base": 570000, "rate": 2.5 } ]
}

### 9. Contabilizar: kardex, lote, cuenta por pagar; devuelve alertas de precio bajo el costo y variación de costo
POST {{api}}/purchasing/purchases/{{purchase.response.body.id}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Existencias por lote y lotes por vencer (30 días ⚙️ inventory.expiry_alert_days)
GET {{api}}/inventory/lots?productId={{yogurt.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{api}}/inventory/lots?expiring=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Cartera: cuentas abiertas y por edades
# @name payables
GET {{api}}/purchasing/payables?supplierId={{supplier.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{api}}/purchasing/payables/aging
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Pago parcial por transferencia (el medio exige referencia)
POST {{api}}/purchasing/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "{{supplier.response.body.id}}", "paymentMethodId": "{{methods.response.body.$[3].id}}", "reference": "TRF-778",
  "allocations": [ { "accountId": "{{payables.response.body.$[0].id}}", "amount": 300000 } ]
}

### 13. Devolución de 10 unidades al costo de la compra → contabilizar → liquidar con nota crédito
# @name ret
POST {{api}}/purchasing/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseId": "{{purchase.response.body.id}}", "reason": "Empaque inflado",
  "lines": [ { "purchaseLineId": "{{purchase.response.body.lines[0].id}}", "baseQuantity": 10 } ]
}

###
POST {{api}}/purchasing/returns/{{ret.response.body.id}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{api}}/purchasing/returns/{{ret.response.body.id}}/settle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "settlement": "CreditNote", "reference": "NC-55" }

### 14. Estado de cuenta del proveedor (libro de cada cuenta y pagos)
GET {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplier.response.body.id}}/statement
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Compras pendientes de documento soporte (proveedores que no facturan, Fase 11-B)
GET {{api}}/purchasing/purchases?requiresSupportDocument=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Verificación del kardex (incluye las cantidades por lote)
POST {{api}}/inventory/verification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
